<h1>Privacy Policy for the App</h1>
<p>The PhotoNote iOS and Android apps do not track, collect, or transmit any personal data, usage data, or telemetry. All data you create in the app stays on your device. There are no analytics, no crash reporters, and no third-party SDKs that phone home.</p>
<p>The analytics and logging described below apply <strong>only to this website</strong>, not to the app.</p>

